{"story":{"id":"story-d873b6bd35174b1a","title":{"zh":"第一次接触","en":"First Contact"},"category":"stories","image":null,"start":"action.2","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"这什么意思？你是谁？你这个大骗子，毫无疑问。根本没有什么外星人！","en":"What is the meaning of this? Who are you? You deceive us, surely. Aliens do not exist!"},"navigation":{"order":["action.2"],"tree":[{"id":"action.2","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"action.2","title":{"zh":"第一次接触","en":"First Contact"},"texts":[{"zh":"这什么意思？你是谁？你这个大骗子，毫无疑问。根本没有什么外星人！","en":"What is the meaning of this? Who are you? You deceive us, surely. Aliens do not exist!"},{"zh":"不可思议！星星上的来客？这还真是出乎意料。你们可让我们有些措手不及。","en":"Amazing! Visitors from the stars? Well, this is certainly unexpected. You've caught us at a bit of a disadvantage."},{"zh":"来自另一颗星球的访客？我们一直认为外面一定还有其他的感性生命体存在，但即使是这样，此时此刻也是极具里程碑意义的！我们还不太清楚你们的习俗是什么样的。","en":"Visitors from another world? We always thought there must be other sentient beings out there, but even so this feels monumental! We're unsure what the custom is here."},{"zh":"多年以来我们都等待机会进行接触。在这样一个广袤无垠、遍布奇迹的宇宙，我们坚信一定有如同我们一样的生命存在。","en":"For ages we have waited to make contact. In such a vast and wondrous galaxy, we knew there must be others like ourselves."},{"zh":"终于！过了这么久你们终于决定揭示自己的存在了。你们已经观察我们的星球有好一段时间了，我没说错吧？","en":"So! At long last you've decided to reveal yourselves. You've been observing our world for some time, haven't you?"},{"zh":"啊，原来你在这！我们这么多年以来一直在等你方发起接触进程，实在等不及了，所以我们决定迈出第一步。那么现在该怎么办？","en":"Ah, there you are! We've been waiting for you to initiate contact for so long, we decided to make the first move. What happens now?"},{"zh":"欧，这就是你们的沟通方式吗？其实你们刚通过超空间航道进来的时候我们就已经一直在关注你们了，但一直没把它弄明白。坐着这种大铁盒子旅行危险不危险啊？\n\n我感觉我们有很多可以互相学习的，如果你们也是这么认为的那么欢迎光临啊。但如果你对我们的家园图谋不轨，我们可不会任人宰割。","en":"Oh, is this how you communicate? We have been watching you ever since you entered through the hyperlane but couldn't figure it out. Isn't it dangerous to travel in those metal boxes?\n\nIt seems like we could learn a lot from each other, so if that is your intention, feel free to stay. If you wish to claim our home, be aware that we are not helpless."},{"zh":"入侵者们！我们不明白你们为什么要攻击我们，但我们会誓死保卫我们的殖民地！至死方休！","en":"Invaders! We don't know why you are attacking us, but know we will fight to defend our colony! We will not yield!"}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"你好，朋友。","en":"Greetings, friends."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"丑陋的东西……你的长相恶心到我们了。","en":"Hideous creatures... Your visage sickens us."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"愿神圣降于你们与你们的星球之上。","en":"Divine greetings upon you and your world."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"你好，同志。","en":"Greetings, comrades."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"我们即将给你们混乱不堪的生活方式带去秩序。稍等。","en":"We will bring order to your chaotic existence. Stand by."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"我们以和平之意前来。","en":"We come in peace."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"我们的相通点远超你们想象。","en":"We are more alike than you realize."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"你们真觉得自己是什么高等文明？妙啊。","en":"You believe yourself an advanced civilization? How quaint."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"我们为一。你们为众。","en":"We are one. You are many."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"我们为一。你们也为一。现在，世界为二。","en":"We are one. You also are one. Now, there are two."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"我们希望能够同你们建立互利互惠的关系。","en":"We hope to build a profitable relationship with you."},"conditional":true,"next":[]}],"next":[{"target":"progress.4","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-cc56194500f66086"},{"target":"progress.5","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-0e9abc59b5da5600"},{"target":"progress.6","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-cc56194500f66086"},{"target":"progress.9","conditional":t